            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The disclosure relates to a laser generating assembly (108) comprising: a housing (112); a first laser generation device (113) configured to generate a first output laser beam of light (116) along a first plane; a second laser generation device (114) configured to generate a targeting laser beam of light (130); and a controller (111) configured to: receive a first signal (202) indicating that the targeting laser beam of light (130) is intersecting a surface (169); and in response to a remote (210) detecting an obstruction, display a warning message (238), generate an audio warning, or blink the first output laser beam of light (116) or the targeting laser beam of light (130).</p>
            </abstract>
